OL,3,AGunman who killed six in Krakow
OL,4,Abelieved to have been inspired by
OL,5,Afar-right ideology, minister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe gunman who killed six people in an
OL,8,Fattack in Krakow is believed to have
OL,9,Fbeen inspired by "far-right
OL,10,Fideologies", Poland's interior minister
OL,11,Fsays
OL,13,FMarcin KierwiEDski says the suspect - a
OL,14,F25-year-old Polish citizen - is in
OL,15,Fcritical condition after being shot by
OL,16,Fpolice. About a dozen people were
OL,17,Finjured in the attack, including two
OL,18,Fpolice officers
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
