OL,3,AGunman who killed six in Krakow
OL,4,Abelieved to have been inspired by
OL,5,Afar-right ideology, minister says
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe adds that the suspect may have taken
OL,8,Fguns from the family's home and there
OL,9,Fare indications he held
OL,10,F"ultra-nationalist views" -
OL,11,Fanti-terrorism police are searching his
OL,12,Fhome
OL,14,FEarlier, a police spokesperson says the
OL,15,Fsuspect was "wearing military-style
OL,16,Fattire" and "used military weapons"
OL,18,FVideo shows gunshots ringing out in the
OL,19,Fsquare; images show emergency services
OL,20,Fat the scene
